{
  "about": "tooling/gate.sh's baselines: each engine's quick run on a fixed seed - `outputs` hashed (exact: a file's bytes, `frames:FILE` a clip's decoded frames, `lines:FILE:REGEX` lines of it) and its throughputs (`speed`: a number read from the run's stderr or stdout by `re`, `better` lower or higher; the better of two runs) - per card, keyed by the card's id (`nextcuda silo`: its name, SM count and memory, rtx-3060-28u-12g; a run over several GPUs: their ids joined by +, in the order the run takes them) with what the card reports (`device`) and the box it was recorded on (`host`). `gpus` are the GPUs (or sets) the run takes on brainiac-nvidia (GPU 0 the RTX 5070, 1 the RTX 3060; NS_GATE_GPUS elsewhere), `run` its paths there (NS_GATE_PATHS maps them elsewhere; {gpu}, {out} the run's directory, {in} the copy's inputs: `setup` makes them), and the shared parts' engines. Recorded with NS_GATE_RECORD=1 on the commit named; a change that moves a number on purpose records it again in its pull request, and a contributor's card gets its own entry recorded on that card.",
  "recorded": "2ef50c8 (2026-11-22): the six first engines on 2ef50c8 (MOSS-Image with bf91372 beside it), ACE-Step on 0e738a5; the rest not recorded yet",
  "tolerance": 0.03,
  "shared": {
    "crates/": [
      "*"
    ],
    "kernels/ns/": [
      "*"
    ],
    "kernels/build.sh": [
      "*"
    ],
    "kernels/image.map": [
      "image/*"
    ],
    "kernels/diffusion/": [
      "image/*",
      "video/*",
      "audio/*",
      "model3d/*",
      "llm/qwen35"
    ],
    "kernels/llm/qwen35/": [
      "image/mossimage",
      "audio/haru"
    ],
    "kernels/llm/nemotronh/": [
      "llm/*",
      "image/mossimage",
      "audio/haru"
    ],
    "llm/contract/": [
      "llm/*"
    ],
    "image/contract/": [
      "image/*"
    ],
    "video/contract/": [
      "video/*"
    ],
    "audio/contract/": [
      "audio/*"
    ],
    "model3d/contract/": [
      "model3d/*"
    ],
    "cli/nextcuda/src/main.rs": [
      "llm/*"
    ],
    "cli/nextcuda/src/image.rs": [
      "image/*"
    ],
    "cli/nextcuda/src/audio.rs": [
      "audio/*"
    ],
    "cli/nextcuda/src/model3d.rs": [
      "model3d/*"
    ],
    "cli/nextcuda/src/video/": [
      "video/*"
    ]
  },
